r>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;}<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;["operationTime"]=&gt;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;object(MongoDB\BSON\Timestamp)#13&nbsp;(2)&nbsp;{<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;["increment"]=&gt;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;string(1)&nbsp;"1"<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;["timestamp"]=&gt;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;string(10)&nbsp;"1635478989"<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;}<br>}</blockquote></div>   </div>  </div> </div> <div class="refsect1 changelog" id="refsect1-mongodb-driver-server.getinfo-changelog">  <h3 class="title">更新日志</h3>  <table class="doctable informaltable">       <thead>     <tr>      <th>版本</th>      <th>说明</th>     </tr>    </thead>    <tbody class="tbody">     <tr>      <td>PECL mongodb 1.11.0</td>      <td>       When the driver is connected to a load balancer, this method returns       the backing server's <span class="literal">hello</span> command response from the       initial connection handshake.      </td>     </tr>    </tbody>     </table> </div> <div class="refsect1 seealso" id="refsect1-mongodb-driver-server.getinfo-seealso">  <h3 class="title">参见</h3>  <ul class="simplelist">   <li><span class="function">{@link MongoDB\Driver\ServerDescription::getHelloResponse()} - Returns the server's most recent "hello" response</span></li>   <li><a href="https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/hello/" class="link external">»&nbsp;hello</a> command in the MongoDB manual</li>   <li><a href="https://github.com/mongodb/specifications/blob/master/source/server-discovery-and-monitoring/server-discovery-and-monitoring.md" class="link external">»&nbsp;Server Discovery and Monitoring Specification</a></li>  </ul> </div></div>
